        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compilation from developer Sam Mortimer, combining arcade chaos, perplexing platformers, and cosmic adventures. Each game offers its own unique appeal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Games</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Tower – Time-trial platformer hand-drawn in ballpoint pen. How high can you climb?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in the Hole – “Finite endless runner” where amateur astronauts tumble into a black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eggs – Frantic arcade score-chaser featuring a daring farm robbery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre – Sam’s first game: an utterly bare-bones platformer with scrappy charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre 2 – The follow-up platformer, bigger, bolder, and sweetly narrated by Dillon Bradbury.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre 2 debuts exclusively in this collection. Eggs, Climb the Tower, Mediocre, and Get in the Hole have all been remastered from their mid-2010s editions with refined controls, updated UI, bug fixes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compilation from developer Sam Mortimer, combining arcade chaos, perplexing platformers, and cosmic adventures. Each game offers its own unique appeal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Games</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Tower – Time-trial platformer hand-drawn in ballpoint pen. How high can you climb?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in the Hole – “Finite endless runner” where amateur astronauts tumble into a black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eggs – Frantic arcade score-chaser featuring a daring farm robbery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre – Sam’s first game: an utterly bare-bones platformer with scrappy charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre 2 – The follow-up platformer, bigger, bolder, and sweetly narrated by Dillon Bradbury.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre 2 debuts exclusively in this collection. Eggs, Climb the Tower, Mediocre, and Get in the Hole have all been remastered from their mid-2010s editions with refined controls, updated UI, bug fixes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A remastered collection of five offbeat games – discover Eggs, Climb the Tower, Mediocre, Get in the Hole, and Mediocre 2!",
